---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="AI product manager at Datadog. Personal blog on the impact of AI on society."
	pubDate={new Date()}
>
	<p>
		I'm Capucine, an AI product manager at Datadog, ex-Amazon.
	</p>

	<p>
		At Datadog, I work at the intersection of observability, alerting, and
		AI, on one core question: how to turn massive streams of signals into
		fast, reliable, actionable decisions.
	</p>

	<p>
		Beyond my day job, I'm passionate about philosophy and social sciences, which naturally leads me
		to question the impact of technology (including AI) on society and individuals.
		How is it changing the way we work, the way we decide, the way we relate to each other? 
		Do we still know how to think critically when machines do/influence part of the thinking for us?
		How much should we rely on technology and how much autonomy should we preserve?   
		This blog is where I'll reason through those questions.
	</p>

	<p>
		Always happy to talk with people working on the future of AI. Find me on
		<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/capucine-m-a3511385/">LinkedIn</a>.
	</p>

	<p>
		<em
			>Everything I write here reflects my own personal thinking, not the
			views of my employer.</em
		>
	</p>
</Layout>
